%% Mermaid sequence diagram: Pod termination and TCP RST propagation
sequenceDiagram
    participant K8s as Kubelet
    participant Pod as App Pod
    participant OS as Host TCP Stack
    participant Client as Remote Client

    Note over K8s,Pod: Scale-down decision (HPA/Controller)
    K8s->>Pod: SIGTERM
    Pod->>Client: Optional preStop drain (graceful close)
    par Grace period
        Pod-->>OS: close sockets / cleanup
        OS-->>Client: FIN (if graceful)
    and Kill
        K8s->>Pod: SIGKILL (after grace period)
        Pod-->>OS: (immediate termination)
        OS-->>Client: TCP RST propagation (~30s)
    end
    Client->>Client: detect broken socket (after RST)
    Client->>Service: reconnect attempt(s)
